                         "fontSize":  14,
                         "fontFamily":  1,
                         "text":  "The AI client launches it - it spawns MCP3.exe as a child process and speaks\nMCP over stdin/stdout, using the command from claude_desktop_config.json.\nNo Windows service, no network port: one server process per client session.",
